{
  "dom_id": "step-10424",
  "name": "Example: \n                    Determining the Length of the Diagonal or Side of a Square Given its Perimeter",
  "problem": "Find the length of the diagonal $\\overline{AC}$ of the square $ABCD$ if the perimeter of the square is $p=256\\,\\mathrm{mm}.$",
  "worked_solution": "Since the perimeter is $p=256\\,\\textrm{mm},$ the length of a single side is\n\n$$\nAB = \\dfrac{p}{4} = \\dfrac{256}{4} = 64\\,\\mathrm{mm}.\n$$\n\nNow, consider $\\triangle{ABC}$, which is an isosceles right triangle since $\\angle{ABC} = 90^\\circ$ and $AB=BC.$\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/capture/linear/14182820/assets/5bb28a161b88919351ee8e83c2943817f20c124d80fb24c4ceffe29129fbbb07.png)\n\nThe hypotenuse in an isosceles right triangle is equal to $\\sqrt{2}$ times the length of a leg.\n\nHere, the length of a leg is $AB=64,$ so the length of the hypotenuse is\n\n$$\nAC = \\sqrt{2}\\cdot AB = \\sqrt{2}\\cdot 64 = 64\\sqrt{2}\\,\\textrm{mm}.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the diagonal of the square $ABCD$ has a length of $AC= 64 \\sqrt{2} \\, \\textrm{mm}.$",
  "calculator_instructions": "",
  "fields": [],
  "problem_field_keys": [],
  "answer_fields_complete": null,
  "result": null,
  "proof_feedback": null,
  "html": "<div id=\"step-10424\" class=\"step\" style=\"display: block\" stepid=\"10424\" steptype=\"example\" contentid=\"3082\">\n            <div class=\"stepHeader\">\n                <div class=\"stepName\">\n                    Example: \n                    <a id=\"stepAnchor-10424\" class=\"stepAnchor\" style=\"font-weight: normal;\" name=\"step-12\">Determining the Length of the Diagonal or Side of a Square Given its Perimeter</a> \n                </div>      \n                <div class=\"helpButton\" stepid=\"10424\">?</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"exampleQuestion\">\n                <style type=\"text/css\">\n                            .mjpage .MJX-monospace {\n                            font-family: monospace\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage .MJX-sans-serif {\n                            font-family: sans-serif\n                            }\n\n                            .mjpage {\n                            display: inline;\n                            font-style: normal;\n                            font-weight: normal;\n                            line-height: normal;\n                            font-size: 100%;\n                            font-size-adjust: none;\n                            text-indent: 0;\n                            text-align: left;\n                            text-transform: none;\n                            letter-spacing: normal;\n                            word-spacing: normal;\n                            word-wrap: normal;\n                            white-space: nowrap;\n                            float: none;\n                            direction: ltr;\n                            max-width: none;\n                            max-height: none;\n                            min-width: 0;\n                            min-height: 0;\n                            border: 0;\n                            padding: 0;\n                           